  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4e6e90cc-e09f-47f8-ba1a-247bb00efefa",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 780,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## create_callback_request (new)\n`POST /webhook/create-callback-request`\n\n**Body:** `business_id`, `customer_name`, `phone`, `reason`, `preferred_callback_time` (optional)\n\nThe fallback path whenever booking is disabled, a service isn't bookable, get_availability can't find a workable time, or availability isn't tracked for this business at all. Writes to `callback_requests`, scoped to the resolved business -- this never creates an appointment or a calendar event. There is no real notification channel wired up yet (see docs/n8n-setup.md); `callback_number`/`callback_notify_channel` are returned as this business's stated preference, not a confirmation that anything was sent."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "34ad56ad-5cf3-4a1d-bb34-d69d6667f467",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1060,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "create-callback-request",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "create-callback-request-placeholder",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_N8N_GATEWAY_HEADER_AUTH_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "ReceptionFlow Gateway Shared Secret (placeholder)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d0428daa-ac2a-4938-82b5-f766f9f9484b",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -840,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "function normalizePhone(raw) {\n  const digits = String(raw || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  if (digits.length < 7 || digits.length > 15) return null;\n  return '+' + digits;\n}\n\n// create_callback_request — Validate Input\nconst body = $input.first().json.body || {};\n\nconst businessId = String(body.business_id ?? '').trim();\nconst customerName = String(body.customer_name ?? body.name ?? '').trim();\nconst rawPhone = String(body.phone ?? body.customer_phone ?? '').trim();\nconst reason = String(body.reason ?? '').trim();\nconst preferredCallbackTime = String(body.preferred_callback_time ?? '').trim() || null;\n\nconst errors = [];\nif (!businessId) errors.push('business_id is required');\nif (!customerName) errors.push('customer_name is required');\n\nconst phoneE164 = normalizePhone(rawPhone);\nif (!rawPhone) {\n  errors.push('phone is required');\n} else if (!phoneE164) {\n  errors.push('phone must contain 7-15 digits, including country code');\n}\n\nif (!reason) errors.push('reason is required');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid: errors.length === 0,\n    errors,\n    business_id_input: businessId,\n    customer_name: customerName,\n    phone_e164: phoneE164,\n    reason,\n    preferred_callback_time: preferredCallbackTime,\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
